        "amd64": {
          "format": "builtin"
        }
      },
      "hosts": {
        "install": [
          "registry.npmjs.org",
          "cdn.npmmirror.com"
        ],
        "signin": [
          "claude.ai",
          "claude.com",
          "console.anthropic.com",
          "platform.claude.com",
          "platform.anthropic.com"
        ],
        "run": [
          "api.anthropic.com"
        ],
        "telemetry": []
      },
      "project_files": [
        ".claude/settings.json",
        ".claude/settings.local.json",
        ".mcp.json"
      ],
      "mark": {
        "builtin": "claude"
      },
      "measured": null,
      "review": {
        "by": "agent-clients step 1.1",
        "date": "2026-11-22",
        "sources": [],
        "notes": [
          "Describes today's path only: setup --preinstall (cmd/cage/main.go), the cloud image (deploy/cloud/build-guest.sh), cage_install_tool claude in internal/cage/guest-tools.sh, and 更新环境工具. Nothing installs, updates or removes Claude Code through the catalog.",
          "Install hosts read in internal/cage/guest-tools.sh (cage_cache_claude: registry.npmjs.org, cdn.npmmirror.com); sign-in hosts in internal/cage/browser-login.mjs. hosts.telemetry is left empty: its only source is unreviewed research notes."
        ]
      }
