        "notes": [
          "Pin: version, URL and sha512 copied from the per-platform manifests the vendor installer reads (read 2026-11-22). The sha512 of each tarball downloaded that day matched; so did the md5 in the storage object metadata. The manifest is the vendor's checksum, not a signature; Cage downloads the versioned URL and never reads the manifest at install.",
